Z||000000||DavidHenshaw||07-12-2001||11:05 PM||||Doug Kinney runs Fiero Warehouse in Glendale WVa. I heard about him at the Mid Ohio show last month from a guy in the Pittsburg area, can't remember his name. Anyway I needed a headlamp motor and he recommended Doug.<P>I finally got up there, its just south of Wheeling WVa and Doug was more than helpful. His web address is <A HREF="http://geocities.com/fierowarehouse/" TARGET=_blank>http://geocities.com/fierowarehouse/</A> <BR>I highly recommend him.<P>Dave<P>86 GT||||reg||1
Z||000001||stimpy||07-12-2001||11:11 PM||||Ditto.<BR>Doug is an awesome guy to do business with, his GT sailpanels are top-notch. I know there are a lot of other members of the forum who would happily add their seal of approval.||||reg||1
